      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_%D0%91%D1%83%D1%80%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B6_(%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4_%D1%81%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%85%D1%83).jpg",
      "width": 1300,
